{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>A man shall not be established by wickedness</b> — he shall not be moved in time of trouble. And their root is a parable for the remnant of their seed after their death. Another interpretation: just as the root is not moved, so the righteous shall stand and not be moved."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:17.775569519Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}